{"title":"얼음 성벽 [단행본]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=1IXzI/dJMcafthwwy/LTGEIhMTqfjkJiIapRwJ8K&filename=th3","synopsis":"사람을 대하는 것이 서툴러 타인과의 사이에 벽을 세워 버리는 히카와 코유키. 고등학교에서는 아무와도 친해지지 않고 혼자 지내왔지만, 어째서인지 쉽게 거리를 좁혀오는 아마미야 미나토를 만나게 되는데…? 고고한 얼음 여왕 코유키, 학교 최고 인기인 미키, 친숙하고 스스럼없는 남자 미나토, 낙천적이고 상냥한 농구부 부원 히노 요타. 어딘가 조금 독특한 4명의 청춘 이야기! KORI NO JOHEKI © 2020 by Kocha Agasawa/SHUEISHA Inc.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":82,"change":{"type":"down","amount":42}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":122,"change":{"type":"down","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":254,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":243,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":103,"change":{"type":"up","amount":140}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":241,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":84,"change":{"type":"up","amount":157}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":168,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":133,"change":{"type":"up","amount":35}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":173,"change":{"type":"down","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":77,"change":{"type":"up","amount":96}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":44,"change":{"type":"up","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":58,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":72,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":89,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":155,"change":{"type":"down","amount":66}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":104,"change":{"type":"up","amount":51}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":106,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":88,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":253,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":69,"change":{"type":"up","amount":184}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":147,"change":{"type":"down","amount":78}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank"